{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And he took from their hand, and he shaped.</b> From the root of צורה, like ויצר את שני העמודים (1 Kings 7:15)." "And the word בחרט is like דמות, as in בחרט אנוש (Isaiah 8:1) — 'in the form of a man.' And there is no reason for it to be from the root החריטים (Isaiah 3:22)." "<b>Molten image.</b> Cast, like הפסל נסך חרש (Isaiah 40:19)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {1 "Ibn Ezra explicitly connects בחרט in Exodus to בחרט in Isaiah 8:1, then glosses it as 'in the form of a man'; rendered the chain literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:41.528735196Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}